games.desc:
Welcome to Noob Incremental! A massive Incremental game with hundreds of Upgrades, dozens of Stats, multiple Prestige layers, and many Features to explore! ✨

How to play:
🤓 Buy Noobs and make Oof!
⚡ Buy Upgrades and be Stronger!
🍀 Roll Runes and Level them up!
🔥 Prestige and unlock new content!
🏆 Reach the top and become the ultimate Noob!

💎 Roblox Plus players get +10% Oof and +10% Prism!
💖 Join the Group and Like the game for +10% Rune Speed!
🎉 Join the Community Server for +10% Rune Luck!

